    {
      "id": "claim_67934844641643689d45b45541361409",
      "statement": "OpenAI's vcr_config fixture extends base_vcr_config with partner-specific redaction: before_record_request and before_record_response hooks redact all headers, URIs, and OAuth secrets (access_token, refresh_token, id_token, code, client_secret) from both request and response bodies; it detects binary magic byte prefixes (PNG, JPEG, PDF, WAV, MP3) and skips regex scanning on confirmed binary for performance.",
